          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "Vide aforesaid order, learned Additional Sessions Judge, while setting aside summoning order, also quashed the complaint on the ground that no case much less under Section 34 of the Act is made out against the accused, named in the complain"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "34985d5e33c84f0d9ceb9b49c329494e_23",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "FAC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
            "matched_text": "set aside",
            "start": 120,
            "end": 129
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "\nIn the aforesaid background, petitioner-State has approached this Court in the instant proceedings,\npraying therein to set aside order dated 17.09.2021 passed by learned Additional Sessions Judge and thereafter, restore the order dated 28."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "51506d520147498dad73e14404e78bb3_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "4. Having heard learned counsel for the parties and perused material available on record vis--vis reasoning assigned in the impugned order passed by learned Additional Sessions Judge, this Court finds no illegality or infirmity in the same "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "67162ff4113e4670817c0071457968b3_25",
        "summary_section": "issue",
        "labels": [
          "ISSUE"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:issue"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is no dispute that Food Safety Officer, at whose instance complaint under Section 34 of the Act, came to be instituted against the accused, named in the complaint, had never recovered tobacco product from the possession of the accused"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c296a9069b3f4c44aff4314788bef85c_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "To invoke Section 34 of the Act, it was incumbent upon the complainant i.e. Food Safety Officer to prove that prohibited .\ntobacco products meant for human consumption were found in possession of the accused for the purpose of the sale and "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7ce52b268f514b0782bbb056bd522e9c_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Otherwise also, bare perusal of Section 34 of the Act, clearly reveals that at first instance Commissioner of Food Safety can serve emergency prohibition notices and orders to the food business operators that too if the designated officer i"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8f041b19e9c04d29ae25ce9aa8179473_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Any person who knowingly contravenes such an order shall be guilty of an offence 2024:HHC:7129 and shall be punishable with imprisonment for a term which may extend to two years and with fine which may extend to rupees two .\nlakhs.\n7."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4506c6c8c9df4069af6035146b358524_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the instant case before initiation of proceedings under Section 34 of the Act, at no point of time, document, if any, ever came to be adduced on record suggestive of the fact that Food Inspector had served prohibition notices and orders,"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "71a1b26e97244e73b0889f30fed88cbf_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nSince, in the case at hand very basic ingredients of Section 34 of the Act, are missing and there is nothing to connect accused, named in the complaint, with sale and purchase of prohibited tobacco products meant for human consumption, acc"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "37351d0ae38843798c1ae866b45f908d_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, even at that stage learned trial Judge without bothering to go through the provisions contained under Section 34 of the Act, proceeded to dismiss the application reiterating that prima-facie he is convinced that there is sufficient"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b27721ca6d744edc8cc127ef414aa8f0_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Needless to say, by now it is well settled that while issuing process, Court is not expected to act as post office, rather there has to be application of mind and application of mind must reflect in the 2024:HHC:7129 order."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ff09760b6acb472b95da72d68d856636_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
            "matched_text": "set aside",
            "start": 205,
            "end": 214
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "Since, in the instant case bare perusal of summoning order reveals that Court, while issuing process,\nfailed to take note of .\nprovision of Section 34 of the Act, learned Additional Sessions Judge rightly set aside the summoning order."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2ed049accab6449db2d82f1b65e65044_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
            "matched_text": "quashed",
            "start": 411,
            "end": 418
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "Since, no material, worth credence, ever came to be adduced on record alongwith the complaint suggestive of the fact that accused, named in the complaint, were indulging in the sale and purchase of prohibited tobacco products meant for huma"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a38a0c027fdd4186855a70f3911fe3f9_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In this regard, reliance is placed upon the judgment rendered by Hon'ble Apex Court in Pepsi Foods Limited and another vs. Special Judicial Magistrate and others, (1998) 5 Supreme Court Cases 749, wherein it has been held as under:-\nDate Of"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4929b928929c4c289bcf844752dc7d59_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\" 28 ."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "26608a6b7ddd449d939c41bbe98edabd_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Summoning of an accused in a criminal case is a serious matter."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5e48b1e04bba47549f53683823e3c3f3_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Criminal law cannot be set into motion as a matter of course."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2aeb0ac20d2b45e8900535cc9e0dc1ab_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is not that the complainant has to bring only two witnesses to support his allegations in the complaint to have the criminal law set into motion."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c4c91212cc8a4918a8236b79cd84f1c0_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The order of the Magistrate summoning the accused must reflect that he has applied his mind to the facts of the case and the law applicable thereto."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8bae49d338e7483dbd01910ebca3e99b_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He has to examine the nature of allegations made in the complaint and the evidence both oral and documentary in support thereof and would that be sufficient for the complainant to succeed in bringing charge home to the accused."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bee02a9df08d45969e2cc628195c093a_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is not that the Magistrate is a silent spectator at the time of recording of preliminary evidence before summoning of the accused."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bd47afd8ebfe45ccaaf187b91de4fcb3_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Magistrate has to carefully scrutinise 2024:HHC:7129 the evidence brought on record and may even himself put questions to the complainant and his witnesses to elicit answers to find out the truthfulness of the allegations or otherwise a"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9702b0c3359544ccae3b685bfbf19dd1_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Since in the instant case, very foundation of the case under Section 34 of the Act is shaky/weak, no illegality or infirmity can be said to have been committed by learned Additional Sessions Judge, while passing impugned order, which otherw"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a08e24c62a3c45609a056358152e6afa_47",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "10. Consequently, in view of the above, the present appeal fails and is accordingly dismissed alongwith pending applications, if any."
      }
